{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8188","id":5246931376,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABOL3RsA","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8188","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8188.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8188.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8188","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8188/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8188/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8188/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/91de65d05f5da5ae44fb563270086676d2b863fb","number":8188,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(power-guard): reap stalled inhibitor child off the sampling loop (#8183)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes the CodeRabbit finding filed as #8183 on this PR's head branch: `Inhibitor._reap()` / `release()` waited synchronously (wait 5s, kill, wait 5s), so reaping a stalled `systemd-inhibit` child blocked the sampling loop for up to ~10s and delayed a confirmed emergency sleep.\n\nThis PR targets `fix/6534-power-guard-dead-child` (PR #8025's branch) because `_reap` exists only there — it is not on `main` yet. Merging this PR lands the fix on #8025 directly; no competing PR against `main` was created.\n\n## Changes (`nixos/services/power-guard/power-guard.py`)\n- Live child release: short inline grace wait (`REAP_GRACE = 0.5s`); on timeout the kill-escalation reap finishes on a background thread while sampling continues. The existing timeout/kill safeguards are preserved in `_finish_reap`.\n- A release is never silently believed: the background reap logs the child exit, or logs `INHIBIT release UNCONFIRMED` loudly when the child survives escalation.\n- `held` / `engage()` account for an in-flight reap: no second inhibitor is stacked and the lock is not reported released while the child still runs.\n- Confirmed-sleep path in `main()`: the release starts when the sustained state confirms, sampling keeps running, and the sleep command is issued only once the release has settled (`reap_settled()`).\n\n## Tests\n- New regression coverage in `test_power_guard.py`: `FakeStalledProc` ignores terminate/kill; the test asserts `release()` returns unsettled in <2s, the lock stays `held`, sampling-side polling continues, kill escalation runs in the background, and the unconfirmed release is logged loudly.\n- Full suite on the laptop: `python3 -m unittest test_power_guard` — 14 tests, OK (including the daemon subprocess scenarios and the #6534 dead-child tests).\n\nQueue: task 14655, lane code-w.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796928386&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8188&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fc